WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.395 --> 00:00:01.845
The issue is fixed.

2
00:00:01.845 --> 00:00:04.366
How do you keep a record of this verification?

3
00:00:06.395 --> 00:00:08.720
Save repetitive actions as a test case.

4
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:11.518
Next time, just run it again.

5
00:00:14.395 --> 00:00:16.634
See which step is running and how it turned out,

6
00:00:16.634 --> 00:00:18.750
right in the workbench.

7
00:00:22.395 --> 00:00:24.668
When something fails, return to that step.

8
00:00:24.668 --> 00:00:27.206
Compare what you expected with what happened.

9
00:00:30.395 --> 00:00:32.766
Fix it and rerun. The old record stays.

10
00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:36.382
Review what you want to share, then export a report.

11
00:00:38.395 --> 00:00:40.459
This is FlowAssert.

12
00:00:40.459 --> 00:00:44.670
Run each verification again, and revisit the evidence anytime.
